---
title: "repay_flash_loan_increase_referral_qualification (flash_loan.move)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: app.ensure_version_matches()
    q_version --> q_validate_market: app.validate_market(market)
    q_validate_market --> q_emit: emit RepayFlashLoanEvent
    q_emit --> q_get_referral: referral = app.referral_mut()
    q_get_referral --> q_track: track_referral(referral, sender, loan_amount, coin_type, registry, oracle, clock)
    q_track --> q_map_code: maybe_referral_code = referral.try_map_referral_code(sender, maybe_referral_code)
    q_map_code --> q_repay: market.repay_flash_loan(coin, loan, referral, maybe_referral_code, ctx)
    q_repay --> [*]: loan consumed

    note right of q_version
        INV-001: Version must match current protocol version
    end note

    note right of q_emit
        INV-002: Event amount = coin.value() (total repay amount)
        INV-003: Event fee = loan.fee()
    end note

    note right of q_track
        INV-004: track_referral uses loan.loan_amount() not coin.value() for qualification
        INV-005: Oracle price is fetched at call time - potential price manipulation vector
    end note

    note right of q_repay
        INV-006: FlashLoan hot potato consumed atomically
        INV-007: Referral code may or may not be applied depending on try_map_referral_code result
    end note
